Package: nbashotpackage
Title: Locations of Shots in NBA Games from 2001 to 2022
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Aidan", "Scott", , "scottaidan0403@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package aims to compare the locations of shots in the NBA over time. Specifically, comparing the locations of shots on the court in the 2001-2002 season to those in the 2021-2022 season. 
